ellness supplement combining traditional Ayurvedic herbs with essential vitamins and minerals, designed to support respiratory wellness and everyday health."],["What is inside?","Botanicals: Jeera (cumin), Karumanjal (black turmeric), Sukku (dry ginger), Thippili (long pepper), black pepper, Tulsi, Vasaka, licorice root and small onion extract. Added nutrients: Vitamin C, Vitamin D3 and Zinc."],["How many gummies should I take?","Follow the serving size and frequency on the approved pack label. Do not exceed the recommended daily intake."],["How does it work?","It combines traditional Ayurvedic botanicals with essential vitamins and minerals to provide nutritional and botanical support for everyday respiratory wellness."],["What flavour is it, and how many are in a pack?","Natural berry flavour, 60 gummies per pack."]],"brochure":"/brochures/pulmoclear.pdf"}$pd$::jsonb,
