Roll-On?","A plant-based topical roll-on designed for menstrual comfort and personal care, as part of a soothing self-care and relaxation routine."],["What is in it?","Wintergreen oil, peppermint oil, ginger essential oil, lavender essential oil, eucalyptus oil and sesame oil."],["Where and how often do I apply it?","Roll onto the lower abdomen, lower back or inner wrists and massage gently until absorbed. Reapply 2–4 times daily or as needed during the cycle."],["Is it a painkiller?","No. It is an external personal-care product for comfort and relaxation, not a medicine. Severe or unusual period pain should be checked by a doctor."],["Can children use it?","No. Do not use on children, and keep it out of their reach."]],"brochure":"/brochures/cyclerelief.pdf"}$pd$::jsonb,
