n as part of a daily personal-care and wellness routine."],["How do I use it?","Roll gently around the belly button every morning on an empty stomach and massage gently. Use daily, and wash your hands after use."],["What are the ingredients?","Dill essential oil and Eucalyptus essential oil."],["Is it a medicine?","No. It is a topical personal-care product. Please continue any medicines and check-ups your doctor has advised."],["Can I use it on cuts or irritated skin?","No. Only apply on intact skin."]],"brochure":"/brochures/reviva.pdf"}$pd$::jsonb,
