igned to support people on their journey towards a smoke-free lifestyle."],["What is in it?","Peppermint, eucalyptus, lavender, lemon, black pepper and tulsi oils."],["Can it help me quit smoking?","Its aroma is intended to promote relaxation and help manage cravings, as convenient support during your quit attempt. It is not a nicotine replacement or a medicine."],["Is it addictive?","It contains no nicotine and is a non-addictive formulation."],["How do I use it?","Remove the cap, place the inhaler near each nostril and take slow, deep inhalations. Repeat whenever you experience cravings or feel stressed."]],"brochure":null}$pd$::jsonb,
